Dialogue: 0,0:01:59.31,0:02:01.27,OP3 Japanese,,0,0,0,,{\fad(100,100)\blur3}Destiny is mine
Dialogue: 0,0:02:01.27,0:02:03.39,OP3 Japanese,,0,0,0,,{\fad(100,100)\blur3}osore shitte mo
Dialogue: 0,0:02:03.39,0:02:07.82,OP3 Japanese,,0,0,0,,{\fad(100,100)\blur3}subete no mirai togirenu you ni
Dialogue: 0,0:02:07.82,0:02:14.07,OP3 Japanese,,0,0,0,,{\fad(100,100)\blur3}Shoot a thread of light
Dialogue: 0,0:02:16.03,0:02:24.00,OP3 Japanese,,0,0,0,,{\fad(100,100)\blur3}itami o norikoeru tabi
Dialogue: 0,0:02:24.00,0:02:33.72,OP3 Japanese,,0,0,0,,{\fad(100,100)\blur3}kokoro wa eiri ni togisumasareru (Never give up)
Dialogue: 0,0:02:33.72,0:02:42.06,OP3 Japanese,,0,0,0,,{\fad(100,100)\blur3}kurikaesareru shukumei no saihate de
Dialogue: 0,0:02:42.06,0:02:45.85,OP3 Japanese,,0,0,0,,{\fad(100,100)\blur3}hikari chiru umi ni chikau
Dialogue: 0,0:02:46.52,0:02:48.52,OP3 Japanese,,0,0,0,,{\fad(100,100)\blur3}Getting through
Dialogue: 0,0:02:48.52,0:02:50.69,OP3 Japanese,,0,0,0,,{\fad(100,100)\blur3}ikiru imi o
Dialogue: 0,0:02:50.69,0:02:56.24,OP3 Japanese,,0,0,0,,{\fad(100,100)\blur3}sekai ni nokosu kara
Dialogue: 0,0:02:57.03,0:02:58.99,OP3 Japanese,,0,0,0,,{\fad(100,100)\blur3}Heaven’s falling down
Dialogue: 0,0:02:58.99,0:03:01.29,OP3 Japanese,,0,0,0,,{\fad(100,100)\blur3}sora otoshite mo
Dialogue: 0,0:03:01.29,0:03:05.96,OP3 Japanese,,0,0,0,,{\fad(100,100)\blur3}nozomi o kudakou kyouki no kami no
Dialogue: 0,0:03:05.96,0:03:08.00,OP3 Japanese,,0,0,0,,{\fad(100,100)\blur3}Destiny is mine
Dialogue: 0,0:03:08.00,0:03:10.09,OP3 Japanese,,0,0,0,,{\fad(100,100)\blur3}osore shitte mo
Dialogue: 0,0:03:10.09,0:03:14.59,OP3 Japanese,,0,0,0,,{\fad(100,100)\blur3}subete no mirai togirenu you ni
Dialogue: 0,0:03:14.59,0:03:19.05,OP3 Japanese,,0,0,0,,{\fad(100,100)\blur3}tomosu honoo ga
Dialogue: 0,0:03:19.05,0:03:25.23,OP3 Japanese,,0,0,0,,{\fad(100,100)\blur3}inochi no kirameki (Destiny will begin tonight)
Dialogue: 0,0:01:59.31,0:02:01.27,OP3 English,,0,0,0,,{\fad(100,100)\blur3}Le destin est mien
Dialogue: 0,0:02:01.27,0:02:03.39,OP3 English,,0,0,0,,{\fad(100,100)\blur3}Même si la peur me retient
Dialogue: 0,0:02:03.39,0:02:07.82,OP3 English,,0,0,0,,{\fad(100,100)\blur3}Je ne laisserai pas nos futurs être brisés
Dialogue: 0,0:02:07.82,0:02:14.07,OP3 English,,0,0,0,,{\fad(100,100)\blur3}Je tirerai un fil de lumière
Dialogue: 0,0:02:16.03,0:02:24.00,OP3 English,,0,0,0,,{\fad(100,100)\blur3}Chaque fois que je surmonte la douleur
Dialogue: 0,0:02:24.00,0:02:33.72,OP3 English,,0,0,0,,{\fad(100,100)\blur3}Mon cœur devient plus affûté (N’abandonne jamais)
Dialogue: 0,0:02:33.72,0:02:42.06,OP3 English,,0,0,0,,{\fad(100,100)\blur3}Au bout de ce destin sans fin
Dialogue: 0,0:02:42.06,0:02:45.85,OP3 English,,0,0,0,,{\fad(100,100)\blur3}Je fais le serment devant cette océan lumineux
Dialogue: 0,0:02:46.52,0:02:48.52,OP3 English,,0,0,0,,{\fad(100,100)\blur3}Que je tiendrai bon
Dialogue: 0,0:02:48.52,0:02:50.69,OP3 English,,0,0,0,,{\fad(100,100)\blur3}Même si je tombe ici
Dialogue: 0,0:02:50.69,0:02:56.24,OP3 English,,0,0,0,,{\fad(100,100)\blur3}Je lèguerai le sens de la vie
Dialogue: 0,0:02:57.03,0:02:58.99,OP3 English,,0,0,0,,{\fad(100,100)\blur3}Le ciel s’effondre
Dialogue: 0,0:02:58.99,0:03:01.29,OP3 English,,0,0,0,,{\fad(100,100)\blur3}Même si le firmament me tombe dessus
Dialogue: 0,0:03:01.29,0:03:05.96,OP3 English,,0,0,0,,{\fad(100,100)\blur3}Je briserai les desseins d’un dieu fou
Dialogue: 0,0:03:05.96,0:03:08.00,OP3 English,,0,0,0,,{\fad(100,100)\blur3}Le destin est mien
Dialogue: 0,0:03:08.00,0:03:10.09,OP3 English,,0,0,0,,{\fad(100,100)\blur3}Même si la peur me retient
Dialogue: 0,0:03:10.09,0:03:14.59,OP3 English,,0,0,0,,{\fad(100,100)\blur3}Je ne laisserai pas nos futurs être brisés
Dialogue: 0,0:03:14.59,0:03:19.05,OP3 English,,0,0,0,,{\fad(100,100)\blur3}J’allume une flamme
Dialogue: 0,0:03:19.05,0:03:25.23,OP3 English,,0,0,0,,{\fad(100,100)\blur3}L’étincelle de la vie (Le destin commencera ce soir)
Dialogue: 0,0:22:14.98,0:22:20.03,ED Lyrics,,0,0,0,,{\fad(100,100)\fs65}Même si tu penses que je fais face
Dialogue: 0,0:22:20.03,0:22:25.28,ED Lyrics,,0,0,0,,{\fad(100,100)\fs65}Ma tête est remplie d'espoir
Dialogue: 0,0:22:25.28,0:22:34.17,ED Lyrics,,0,0,0,,{\fad(100,100)\fs65}D'un quelconque endroit autre qu'ici
Dialogue: 0,0:22:35.21,0:22:40.21,ED Lyrics,,0,0,0,,{\fad(100,100)\fs65}Même si tu penses que je souris
Dialogue: 0,0:22:40.21,0:22:45.55,ED Lyrics,,0,0,0,,{\fad(100,100)\fs65}Intérieurement et pendant tout ce temps
Dialogue: 0,0:22:45.55,0:22:53.85,ED Lyrics,,0,0,0,,{\fad(100,100)\fs65}Je m'interroge sur mon destin
Dialogue: 0,0:22:54.48,0:23:00.44,ED Lyrics,,0,0,0,,{\fad(100,100)\fs65}Je pense à
Dialogue: 0,0:23:00.44,0:23:05.36,ED Lyrics,,0,0,0,,{\fad(100,100)\fs65}Toutes les choses
Dialogue: 0,0:23:05.36,0:23:10.29,ED Lyrics,,0,0,0,,{\fad(100,100)\fs65}Que j'aimerais faire
